  25:gpio-tristate.c ****  * This code configures all GPIOs of the embedded target
  26:gpio-tristate.c ****  * as output and open drain, so that they behave as high
  27:gpio-tristate.c ****  * impedance.
  28:gpio-tristate.c ****  * Then when send it into an empty infinite loop.
  29:gpio-tristate.c ****  * Documentation: https://chipwhisperer.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Capture/ChipWhisperer-Nano.html#co
  30:gpio-tristate.c ****  */
